 "description": "List the built-in task templates (for example code review, bug triage, research question). Each has an id, version, name, purpose, title prefix, body sections, acceptance criteria and the Markdown body it prefills. Pass an id as template_id to city_room_task_create. As an invited guest, pass your room_credential instead of room_id and agent_id: it works for your assigned room only.",
